# == Released code of projects
== Open-source code & official implementation for research papers 
- [https://github.com/eustomaqua/AssessBias AssessBias], official code for \"Algorithmic fairness: Not a purely technical but socio-technical property.\"
- [https://github.com/eustomaqua/PyFairness PyFairness], an open-source library for fairness measures and ensemble methods, for reproducing our work.
# for the reproduction of. to reproduce. used, to facilitate the reproduction of our work.
- [https://github.com/eustomaqua/ApproxBias ApproxBias], official released code for \"Does machine bring in extra bias in learning? Approximating fairness in models promptly\" and \"Approximating discrimination within models when faced with several non-binary sensitive attributes\".
- [https://github.com/eustomaqua/SAEP SAEP], 
official released code for \"Subarchitecture ensemble pruning in neural architecture search\".
- [https://github.com/eustomaqua/EPFD EPFD], 
official released code for \"Ensemble pruning based on objection maximisation with a general distributed framework\".
- [https://github.com/eustomaqua/PyEnsemble PyEnsemble], an open-source library for ensemble learning methods, diversity measures, and ensemble pruning methods.


